// from cases/rules/classes/a-class-equated-with-two-types-has-no-value.case
// A class equated with u8 and with u16: unified, its structure is their conjunction,
// which no type satisfies, so it has no value, refused.
// not asserted here: assert A: none;
u8_ <- u8;
u16_ <- u16;
a <- u8_; u8_ <- a;
a <- u16_; u16_ <- a;

assert refused ..;
